  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0x8A0F" flags="0x0">
    <title>Map 1 - Knock-State Path Enable - High-Octane State</title>
    <description>Exact JK78C. Address 0x96CA; 16 rows x 16 columns; uint8; map confidence candidate. High-octane hot timing-state surface. It supplies active sample ffff160f when ffff2466.bit6 is clear and remains reference sample ffff1610 when that selector is set. Coordinator 000493e8 also looks it up independently for the conditional signed Q8 difference against 0x9B1A. Common-definition Map 1 uses the canonical stock storage. This view edits mask 0x80 and preserves the other bits in each cell. The code-proven correction path is ffff22fa -&gt; 0004d99c -&gt; ffff12d6 -&gt; 0004dbe8 -&gt; ffff11d4 -&gt; 0004df82. The physical name and x-64 scale match homolog EV18A 0x9a76, but JK08A code does not prove this surface as a direct final angle. Definition address projected from JK08A 00009a1a through JK08A-JK78C.definition-addresses.csv: unique same-contract accessor preserves the first 16x16 ignition surface and operand order.</description>
