  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0x4935" flags="0x0">
    <title>Map 1 - Ignition Timing Surface - High-Detonation State</title>
    <description>Exact JK78C. Address 0x97CA; 16 rows x 16 columns; uint8; map confidence candidate. High-detonation hot timing-state surface. It supplies active sample ffff160f only when ffff2466.bit6 is set; the reference remains high-octane surface 0x9A1A. Coordinator 000493e8 also looks it up independently for the conditional signed Q8 difference from 0x9A1A. Common-definition Map 1 uses the canonical stock storage. This view edits mask 0x7F and preserves the other bits in each cell. Knock evaluation 0004a238 and coordinator 000493e8 form the state loop that updates the selector for a later pass. A code-proven correction path exists through ffff22fa; code does not prove this surface as a direct final angle. The physical name and scale match homolog EV18A 0x9b76. Definition address projected from JK08A 00009b1a through JK08A-JK78C.definition-addresses.csv: unique same-contract accessor preserves the second 16x16 ignition surface and operand order.</description>
