    <description>Exact JK78C. Address 0x1CEF4; 1 rows x 2 columns; uint16; map confidence code. Native VQ37 fuel-cut activation and release scalar caps. Common-definition Map 2 storage is projected from 0x9040. Stock firmware does not reference this allocated storage; it becomes runtime-active only with the project map-switching patch. Exact JK78C native fuel-cut model at 0x6aeb8; selector 0xffff10e5, shared axis 0x16a64. The BSR at coordinator instruction ordinal 28 targets FUN_0006aeb8, the third Boolean predicate aggregated by the final fuel-mask coordinator. It interpolates the adjacent activation and release curves on the shared eight-point axis, caps both results with the adjacent scalar limits, and compares them with the current native RPM word.</description>
