  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0xA15A" flags="0x0">
    <title>Map 4 - Engine Speed Limit - Fuel Cut Curves</title>
    <description>Exact JK78C. Address 0x1E120; 2 rows x 8 columns; uint16; map confidence code. Native VQ37 fuel-cut activation and release curves. Common-definition Map 4 storage is projected from 0x16BF4. Stock firmware does not reference this allocated storage; it becomes runtime-active only with the project map-switching patch. Exact JK78C native fuel-cut model at 0x6aeb8; selector 0xffff10e5, shared axis 0x16a64. The BSR at coordinator instruction ordinal 28 targets FUN_0006aeb8, the third Boolean predicate aggregated by the final fuel-mask coordinator. It interpolates the adjacent activation and release curves on the shared eight-point axis, caps both results with the adjacent scalar limits, and compares them with the current native RPM word. The two rows are interpolated independently; no interpolation occurs between rows.</description>
