  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0x5B3F" flags="0x0">
    <title>Map 5 - Engine Speed Limit - Throttle Request</title>
    <description>Exact JK78C. Address 0x1DF26; 1 rows x 1 columns; uint16; map confidence candidate. Base threshold and disable sentinel for the stateful signed rotational-speed request limiter. FUN 0002c648 initializes ffff1796 from this scalar. FUN 0007584e treats 0xffff as an immediate neutral return. The enabled filter converges to 4*N but uses its entry value for the 0x9424 blend and its newly stored value for the 0x9426/0x9428/0x942a request terms. Engagement requires previous signed ffff19d8 &lt; APP request ffff243c; equality takes the inactive/reset branch. Fast and normal ramp states, an independent final term, a recovery envelope with rollback, forced-neutral synchronization, and auxiliary outputs produce ffff19d8. Periodic indices 18, 20, 21, and 22 carry this candidate through signed-minimum arbitration and controller bounds to shared signed request ffff19c6. The stock-active continuous command path to ATU-II BFR6A-D continues through ffff198a, ffff183e, ffff19b2, per-channel targets ffff28bc/ffff28be, and the feedback regulator. FUN 00077892 also uses the scalar as an unsigned cap while calculating signed transmission candidate ffff4162. Common completion 000777fa can pass that candidate through ffff3480/ffff3484 only while ffff41a6.bit3 is set. Common-definition Map 5 storage is projected from 0x911E. Stock firmware does not reference this allocated storage; it becomes runtime-active only with the project map-switching patch. The stock word is 0x2580, or 7500 candidate RPM, between fuel-cut release 7450 RPM and activation 7650 RPM. Exact SHA-locked ROM execution covers 51 state and sweep cases and 7200..7800 candidate RPM at four APP requests; after 20 measured 10.24 ms passes, APP 10000 yields 10000 at 7500, 7601 at 7600, 5466 at 7700, and 3086 at 7800. The secondary candidate is calculated but stock-lifecycle inactive: 00077892 clears ffff41a6.bit3 because startup-zero ffff418f.bit4 has no producer and retained ffff4413 can be loaded only on the same unreachable transition branch. Calibration-only A/B testing is isolated from that secondary path unless external diagnostics or another patch mutate those state bytes. The limiter never enters fuel mask ffff22e0. Physical plate motion, response time, channel-to-bank identity, ECM terminals, the Throttle Rev Limiter label, and the RPM multiplier require controlled hardware validation. Definition address projected from JK08A 0000942c through JK08A-JK78C.definition-addresses.csv: two homologous consumers preserve the limiter scalar role and stock value.</description>
    <CATEGORYMEM index="0" category="15" />
    <XDFAXIS id="x" uniqueid="0x0" flags="0x0">
